# This directory is intentionally empty.
#
# Next.js serves anything here at the site root. The project currently has no
# static files here — the favicon is generated from src/app/icon.tsx — but the
# Dockerfile copies this directory into the runtime stage, and `COPY` of a
# missing path fails the build outright.
#
# Keeping it means adding public/asset.png later needs no Dockerfile change.